.7% in dividends).","The share count has grown 0.9% a year over five years, diluting existing holders.","It has paid a dividend for 15 consecutive years, though it has been cut 1.2% a year over the last five."],"people":["With about 30,000 employees, each generates about $406K of revenue, in line with the Technology median.","That works out to $104K of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $1.3M (3x revenue per employee).","Stock compensation averages $7K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"WATCH","conv":71,"head":"Watch: priced 75% above its $264 fair value, but that value is low-confidence and the price is inside its $149\u2013$470 range.","pros":["Model rating LEAN BUY (composite 51, gates 12/26)","ROIC 33.1% vs WACC 11.7%","FCF margin 25.5%","Net debt/EBITDA 0.4x","Piotroski F-score 7/9"],"cons":["Trades 75% above fair value of $264","Fair value is low-confidence (wide Monte Carlo spread)","P/FCF 34.1x vs sector 25.4x"],"flags":[],"need":["no margin of safety","the fair value is low-confidence (wide Monte Carlo spread)"],"buy_below":224.23,"vc":{"base":263.8,"base_src":"dcf","bear":148.91,"bull":470.38,"alt_median":72.8,"n_alt":3,"gap":2.6238,"dispersion":0.634,"level":"LOW","why":["Monte Carlo spread is wide","models disagree (63% dispersion)","DCF is 262% above the other models' median ($72.80)","bull case is 3.2x the bear case"]},"med":{"pe":26.7484,"ev_ebitda":16.351,"pfcf":25.4376,"pb":3.7763,"roic":0.0752,"gross_margin":0.4714,"fcf_margin":0.1275,"div_yield":0.0129}},"ticker":"STX","date":"2026-11-06"}